  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FAO - St&#xf6;d till institutionalisering och uppskalning av KIAMIS</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FAO - Support to Institutionalization and Scale-up of KIAMIS - FAO -  Institutionalization and Scale-up of KIAMIS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact level Objective: A well coordinated data and information management system and evidence-based decision-making in the agriculture sector 

Outcome level Objective: The Kenya Integrated Agriculture Management Information System is scaled nationally. FAO will achieve this provision of a government-owned system that strengthens coordination of the digital ecosystem in agriculture, and enhances policy and management decisions that are based on real-time data and information.

Specific Objectives are: to roll out the farmer registration and e-subsidy management modules to all counties; develop  additional modules of KIAMIS; build human and institutional capacities for  the operationalization, uptake and use of the System; strengthen coordination mechanisms and the linkages (both vertical and horizontal) for the successful implementation of KIAMIS - including the recently launched Digital Transformation Committee and its sub-committees; and identify and address policy gaps that hinder acceleration of digitization in the agriculture sector.

Outputs: 
Output 1. KIAMIS modules enhanced. .
Output 2. Digital Solutions for Agriculture (DSA) framework developed. 
Output 3: Increased capacity for uptake and use of KIAMIS.
Output 4: KIAMIS is scaled-up nationally.
Output 5: Digital agriculture innovation centers (DAIC) and call centers created.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xe4;r ett projekt f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka nationella och l&#xe4;nsstyrelsers kapacitet f&#xf6;r effektiv jordbruksdata och kunskapshantering genom ett integrerat informationssystem f&#xf6;r jordbruksledning - Kenya Integrated Agriculture Management Information System (KIAMIS).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a project on strengthening National and County Governments capacity for effective agriculture data and knowledge management through an integrated  Agriculture Management Information System - The Kenya Integrated Agriculture Management Information System (KIAMIS).</narrative>
  </description>
